                    Nodis. All brackets are in the original except those indicating text omitted by
                    the editors. The meeting was held in the White House Situation Room.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d131-f2" n="2" xml:id="d131-f2-content">
                <p>The study, “U.S. Response to an Appeal for Support by King Hussein of Jordan,” undated, is ibid., Box
                    H–078, Washington Special Actions Group Meetings, WSAG Meeting Jordan &amp; Israel 6/22/70.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d131-f3" n="3" xml:id="d131-f3-content">
                <p>The next Ad Hoc Special Review Group meeting was held on July 9; see <ref
                        target="#d133">Document 133</ref>.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
